                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/releases/tag/v13.5.2"&gt;Aspire 13.5.2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's New in Aspire 13.5.2&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Patch release for Aspire 13.5 that removes an unused native helper binary from the Windows CLI archives so 13.5 servicing releases stay publishable to WinGet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🐛 Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🪟 &lt;strong&gt;Windows CLI archives shipped an unused ~4.9 MB &lt;code&gt;hex1bpty.exe&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — The Windows CLI archives (&lt;code&gt;aspire-cli-win-{x64,arm64}-*.zip&lt;/code&gt;) bundled Hex1b's out-of-process PTY host, which Aspire never executes (DCP owns every pseudo-terminal Aspire surfaces). Besides the wasted download, the extra unexplained executable stalled the WinGet publish, since every binary in the archive goes through executable and malware validation. A build-only MSBuild target now drops the file from the CLI publish output; Unix native assets are unaffected. Regression new in 13.5. ([&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19557" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19557/hovercard"&gt;#19557&lt;/a&gt;](&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5208779981" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/19557" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19557/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19557"&gt;#19557&lt;/a&gt;), backport of &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5208556443" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/19554" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19554/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19554"&gt;#19554&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;code&gt;@mitchdenny&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🏷️ Housekeeping&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Bumped branding to 13.5.2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Full Changelog: [&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/compare/v13.5.1...v13.5.2"&gt;v13.5.1...v13.5.2&lt;/a&gt;](&lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/compare/v13.5.1...v13.5.2"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v13.5.1...v13.5.2&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Full commit: [&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/commit/a22cec24d76e764b3681977e314ab4a0aeed0240"&gt;a22cec24d76e764b3681977e314ab4a0aeed0240&lt;/a&gt;](&lt;a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/commit/a22cec24d76e764b3681977e314ab4a0aeed0240/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/commit/a22cec24d76e764b3681977e314ab4a0aeed0240"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;a22cec2&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/releases/tag/v13.5.1"&gt;Aspire 13.5.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's New in Aspire 13.5.1&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Patch release for Aspire 13.5 fixing a TypeScript/Java polyglot AppHost compatibility regression when running the 13.5 SDK under an older (13.4.x) CLI, plus a DCP update and release-pipeline housekeeping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🐛 Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍎 &lt;strong&gt;Polyglot AppHosts could crash on startup on macOS&lt;/strong&gt; — On macOS, polyglot (TypeScript/Python/Java/Go/Rust) AppHosts could crash during startup due to an interaction between how DCP's Go runtime forks detached processes and how .NET Native AOT installs its signal handlers. Updated DCP (Developer Control Plane) to 0.25.13 to resolve the crash. ([&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19528" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19528/hovercard"&gt;#19528&lt;/a&gt;](&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5199316030" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/19528" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19528/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19528"&gt;#19528&lt;/a&gt;))&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;Polyglot AppHosts on the 13.5 SDK crashed under an older CLI with &lt;code&gt;MissingMethodException&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — A TypeScript or Java AppHost built with the 13.5 SDK failed to start when launched by an older (13.4.x) CLI, because the newer codegen called &lt;code&gt;Aspire.TypeSystem&lt;/code&gt; members that don't exist in the CLI's older contract. Code generation now probes for these additive capabilities before using them, so older CLIs skip only the unsupported feature and startup succeeds. Regression introduced in 13.5 by &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5146381329" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/19365" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19365/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19365"&gt;#19365&lt;/a&gt;. Fixes &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5195654404" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/19503" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/issues/19503/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/19503"&gt;#19503&lt;/a&gt;. ([&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19524" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19524/hovercard"&gt;#19524&lt;/a&gt;](&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5199003979" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/19524" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19524/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19524"&gt;#19524&lt;/a&gt;), backport of &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5196101790" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/19506" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19506/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19506"&gt;#19506&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;code&gt;@adamint&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🏷️ Housekeeping&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📦 Updated DCP (Developer Control Plane) to 0.25.13 ([&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19528" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19528/hovercard"&gt;#19528&lt;/a&gt;](&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5199316030" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/19528" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19528/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19528"&gt;#19528&lt;/a&gt;))&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 Restored WinGet publication using .NET 9 &lt;code&gt;wingetcreate&lt;/code&gt; ([&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19509" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19509/hovercard"&gt;#19509&lt;/a&gt;](&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5197497945" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/19509" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19509/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19509"&gt;#19509&lt;/a&gt;))&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧹 Removed the pipeline-scoped &lt;code&gt;Publish-Build-Assets&lt;/code&gt; group from the release pipeline ([&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19523" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19523/hovercard"&gt;#19523&lt;/a&gt;](&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5198917134" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/19523" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19523/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19523"&gt;#19523&lt;/a&gt;), [&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19163" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19163/hovercard"&gt;#19163&lt;/a&gt;](&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5095558895" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/19163" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19163/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19163"&gt;#19163&lt;/a&gt;))&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Bumped branding to 13.5.1 ([&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19531" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19531/hovercard"&gt;#19531&lt;/a&gt;](&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5199658971" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/19531" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/19531/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/19531"&gt;#19531&lt;/a&gt;))&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Full Changelog: [&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/compare/v13.5.0...v13.5.1"&gt;v13.5.0...v13.5.1&lt;/a&gt;](&lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/compare/v13.5.0...v13.5.1"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v13.5.0...v13.5.1&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Full commit: [&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/commit/69db530a4816698cf1d5fa4557933e0ac4f127c6"&gt;69db530a4816698cf1d5fa4557933e0ac4f127c6&lt;/a&gt;](&lt;a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/commit/69db530a4816698cf1d5fa4557933e0ac4f127c6/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/commit/69db530a4816698cf1d5fa4557933e0ac4f127c6"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;69db530&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
